OL,3,GNEWSAArt gallery wins #100,000 award
OL,4,Afor youth projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FWolverhampton Art Gallery has been
OL,7,Fawarded #100,000 to develop more
OL,8,Fopportunities for young people.
OL,10,FThe cultural venue is one of three
OL,11,Fwinners of the inaugural Freelands
OL,12,FAwards, which recognise organisations
OL,13,Fwith "progressive art education
OL,14,Fapproaches with demonstrable impact".
OL,16,FThe gallery was recognised for two
OL,17,Fprojects within its arts and cultures
OL,18,Fyouth programme, which provide free
OL,19,Fsupport for young people to develop
OL,20,Ftheir creative skills and careers.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
